                <mxCell id="22" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Proposed Path&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Player begins in start&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Makes their way to the control room to restore power&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goes to generators in basement&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goes to water valve on the second floor&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goes to steam valves 1 and 2 above the geothermal pit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;returns to the control room&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goes to the roof?&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Goes to the Grid Connection room&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Escape the building by going back to the start&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
